Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.01,0:00:12.01,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}来源：官方字幕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:15.01,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}润色：爪爪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:18.01,Default,TIP,0,0,10,,{\fs65}{\fad(200,200)\an8}压制：相簿、白、囧冏浻烱、120903
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs65\shad0\bord0\c&H6356AC&\pos(960,637.2)}爪爪字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文斯总经理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.01,0:00:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 为什么不经同意 擅自进来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 总经理 刚刚喊了好几声…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.60,0:00:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…我今天可以下班了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.99,0:00:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,实在很抱歉 我今晚有事情
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.41,0:00:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到留意你的日程 也变成我的工作了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.29,0:00:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的 实在对不起您
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.08,0:00:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我今天想帮儿子庆祝考上学院
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.92,0:00:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是祝贺了 期待未来能有更多荒坂公司的生力军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,找人把UG2样本拿过来就行
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这个时间 大家都已下班…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.06,0:01:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我自己去把样本带过来…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.69,0:01:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是要感谢你了 快点去拿来 完事了就快滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文斯总经理
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.80,0:01:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.52,0:01:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,卡顿了一下 有人用干扰器吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的通讯信号很稳定
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.19,0:01:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.91,0:01:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这工作好无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,在荒坂辖区公然谋杀 把我们当傻子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是主攻如何应对军用科技之对策的实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,与杀掉杰米和马库斯的网络黑客有关
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.22,0:03:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,埃文斯经理中了枪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.60,0:03:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,清理现场做得很粗糙 我敢说不是同一个黑客
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.48,0:03:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,逮捕网络黑客是首要目标 他们太危险
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.00,0:03:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不知道他们的动机
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.78,0:03:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,查不到蛛丝马迹
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.94,0:03:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这并非普通的网络黑客
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,想到他们竟敢招惹我们堂堂荒坂反情报部
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得绕远路找网络黑客的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要介入调查埃文斯的案子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这是两个独立的案件 但我们也许能找到交汇的线索
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,换个方法 先去找中间人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.59,0:04:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要找到和军用科技有关系的中间人 并不会太难
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.39,0:04:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果中间人和网络黑客有联系
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.47,0:04:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,很可能反而泄露产品信息给军用科技
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不唯利是图 阴险狡诈 就当不了夜之城的中间人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.82,0:04:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,到头来 还不是跪舔公司赏赐的鬣狗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只需稍加提醒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.49,0:04:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,公司才是城市的主人 只有听话才能活命
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.33,0:04:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.75,0:04:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,就用夜之城惯用的方式告知他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.98,0:05:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,带走中间人 剩下全灭
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是手榴弹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点被杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.09,0:05:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那也不代表荒坂是幕后主使
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,当我傻吗 除了荒坂还有谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.90,0:05:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可不承担任何多余的责任
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也给不了你公司豁免权
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,开玩笑吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.73,0:05:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道田中事件花我们多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,然而你什么都拿不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:06:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,想要更多资金就必须拿出成果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.11,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是 我做的还不够多吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,话不是这么说 但你的确太花时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,荒坂的保安系统比平时更为严苛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这就证明义体金刚对他们有多重要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是知道的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,就是知道 才会投入这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.59,0:06:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,把成果展示给我们看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.61,0:06:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你不证明自己的作用 我们就没法再投资了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.14,0:06:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,今天到此为止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶的公司混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frx12\fry352\org(1546,266)\frz10.03\move(1520,318,1512,360,0,5600)}{\fs50\bord1}荒坂 {\fax-0.08}军用科技
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.61,0:06:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那个中间人有动作了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如我所愿
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.04,0:06:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真是条好狗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我吵醒你了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.39,0:07:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,睡不着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.89,0:07:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不知怎么的 只是想清醒地待着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.27,0:07:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我把电视关了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是在看吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.81,0:07:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是随便开着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.36,0:07:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.76,0:07:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,上月球要25万 比我想的便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.76,0:07:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,只是上去 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.45,0:07:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.54,0:07:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 我要回去睡觉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好 晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,世界第一的公司要在这种鬼地方 谈非法的工作委托
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.60,0:07:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我们以为偶尔用用你们的套路也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.85,0:07:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,算了 我也来了 你的回复呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,义体金刚是非常敏感的话题 连荒坂内部也不例外
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,田中在其中过度隐瞒操作资料 造成了许多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,军用科技知道多少
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,情报是我做交易的根本
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.62,0:08:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在谈到更多细节之前 我需要保证
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.32,0:08:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们尊重你是最为出色的中间人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.41,0:08:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,军用科技拒绝你的所有条件 我们会欣然答应
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,至于田中的烂摊子 就当你抵债两清了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.67,0:08:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不过 我们也有几个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说来听听
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所有知道义体金刚的人都要灭口
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.89,0:08:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.56,0:08:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还有一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.52,0:08:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在田中死后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.19,0:08:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,有位网络黑客干扰我们复原资料
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.70,0:08:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道任何消息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这我就不知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.12,0:08:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们对此事非常好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:09:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是军用科技 我也无法想象他们执行此事的动机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,知道田中和义体金刚之间关联的 除了我之外 应该别无他人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.22,0:09:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是您内部的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能 内部行动无法做到不留痕
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.76,0:09:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是赛博朋克中的黑客高手操刀的 这样的推论比较合理
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,恰好是可以委托你们中间人 进行调查的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是额外的工作委托吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,活捉100万
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体50万
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.82,0:09:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我接受
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然会主动联系我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.91,0:09:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.47,0:09:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.71,0:09:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 只是想问一些事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.47,0:09:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么大事 想问问大卫最近还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.88,0:09:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:10:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,刚开始我以为要帮他很多忙 现在他是真正的团队领导者
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,连法拉第也找他干活
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.98,0:10:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果看到大卫现在的样子 曼恩肯定会惊呆
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.65,0:10:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.03,0:10:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么担心的事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 只要他顺利就好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.08,0:10:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,和他一起工作不就能看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,在我看来 虽然大卫愿意等你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,但他现在很想要你回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.38,0:10:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,还是不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,现在还没 但快结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.35,0:10:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我不多问
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.48,0:10:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在夜之城不要相信任何人 受到背叛是自己的错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这么教你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.23,0:10:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你教的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好 快点归队吧 我等你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.50,0:10:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫都不听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有绞肉喔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.01,0:11:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,没弹了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.87,0:11:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你发什么愣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见 大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,法尔科 我也要下车
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.26,0:11:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 只好咱们俩去喝一杯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.10,0:12:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,法尔科 我也要去别的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 真是群扫兴的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.69,0:12:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.11,0:12:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没去喝酒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,跟老头老太太喝酒不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不敢保证自己会比较有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.07,0:12:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别小看自己
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.62,0:12:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,要散散步吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.58,0:12:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,什么 也是可以
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.44,0:12:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你指什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,今天怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,什么怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.51,0:12:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,少说这些没用的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.76,0:12:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这已经不是第一次了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为我没发现
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.48,0:12:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就那样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.69,0:12:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不要小看女孩子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里有女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.90,0:12:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:13:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我只注意你一个人 你是知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你还想骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.41,0:13:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,跟丽贝卡你没有关系
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.51,0:13:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,最好跟我没关系 我把命交在你手里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.47,0:13:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…我在想 大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.59,0:13:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,暂时别再加用义体了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会罩着你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.03,0:13:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我很认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.14,0:13:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,记得杀掉我哥的那个赛博疯子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.06,0:13:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,记得
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的不想…看到你变成那样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.12,0:13:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他们还在派出网络黑客
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.38,0:14:44.47,Default,,0,0,0,,只剩下目标一人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,和情报吻合
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.43,0:14:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,门开了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,确认进入路线
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.20,0:14:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.10,0:14:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么人 搞什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.04,0:15:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 你好了吗 大楼里还有一个
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,朝你的方向移动中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.55,0:15:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你听得见吗 大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,听…得到
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.32,0:15:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,从刚才开始怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.48,0:15:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我说有人冲你过去了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.41,0:15:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,处理好了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.75,0:15:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在出去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.59,0:16:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs50\frz1.876\frx358\fry4\org(826,330)\pos(1048,312)}{\bord0\c&HDCCB93&}荒坂学院
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.49,0:16:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.38,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你终于醒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,大夫…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,症状消退了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.78,0:16:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,什么时候开始的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,手抖 眩晕 恶心 你都有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有一阵子了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.08,0:16:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么没告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.52,0:16:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为是暂时的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.53,0:16:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看来副作用终究还是追上你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.46,0:16:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 目前为止都没事 已经很疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.51,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么是现在
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,义体改造先暂停一段时间
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经在赛博精神病的边缘了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.48,0:17:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那就给我更强的药
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.15,0:17:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 难不成已经疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这种状况 根本无药可救
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.37,0:17:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,闭上你的臭嘴 把药交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是就要钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去 我给你开的最后一次药
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,标准剂量的九倍 可以用九天
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,足够把你直接送到边缘
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.09,0:17:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,直到彻底失控 葬身地狱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.40,0:17:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 不会再发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.57,0:17:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上了那些药 也就代表你不会再回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一个帮卖黑超梦的小鬼 现在竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,去做你们赛博朋克的传奇人物 还是随便什么事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.76,0:18:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你的传奇 我会传下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.70,0:18:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.89,0:18:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟大家说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.40,0:18:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.70,0:18:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道义体改造总有极限
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.43,0:18:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,普通的免疫抑制剂已经控制不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.94,0:18:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这还不够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我不忍心看你恶化下去 把植入体拆了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.63,0:18:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.09,0:18:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈和曼恩临死前都有事交代我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我什么都没做到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:03.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那你也不能…继续这样下去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.18,0:19:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的话 会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会 你真的觉得自己很特别吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.61,0:19:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我承受得了沙德威斯坦 我至少不普通
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你或许是比普通人更能承受义体 但说回来 你也还是普通人类
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.21,0:19:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我射杀了一个女人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.30,0:19:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.32,0:19:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她和我妈年纪差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.88,0:19:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,也有一个像我一样的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不是罪犯 只是个普普通通的路人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,事到如今 我抹杀的对象早已数不清
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,杀人之时 内心甚至不会有一丝波澜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:19:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我或许是真的要疯了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,大卫…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.45,0:19:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.45,0:20:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你和我 的确已经不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.52,0:20:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,没有不同
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.70,0:20:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,已经不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.70,0:20:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没有不同…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.56,0:20:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你的确不能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,曼恩死后 你退出团队
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.09,0:20:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.55,0:20:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要你变得和我一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.47,0:20:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 大卫 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.97,0:20:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那你愿意回到团队里来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就和之前一样 一起工作
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.40,0:20:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在没办法 再等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.98,0:20:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有一件事我得先完成
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你细节
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.58,0:20:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.21,0:20:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,连我都不能说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.71,0:20:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.09,0:20:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 我不会再问
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.56,0:20:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,也许 我们分手会比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 我不是这个意思 大卫
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.11,0:21:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 大卫 我…一定要先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.32,0:21:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我得先走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.28,0:21:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.03,0:21:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回家再把话说完
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.08,0:21:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 等着我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.01,0:21:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\frx10\fry0\frz2.118\pos(252,936)}{\shad0\bord0\fs40\c&H2425A5&}监控录像网络{\fax-0.03}系统 {\fax-0.1}监控机位
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,和之前那位黑客的ID吻合
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.09,0:21:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,终于找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到这么容易
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们通往荒坂的敲门砖
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.08,0:22:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 琦薇
Comment: 0,0:22:12.12,0:22:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.05,0:02:11.44,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes burning a way through me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.63,0:02:17.79,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Eyes destroying so sweetly
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.02,0:02:24.34,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}Now there is a fire in me
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.75,0:02:32.52,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}A fire that burns
Dialogue: 1,0:02:58.87,0:03:01.58,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}This fire is out of control
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.58,0:03:02.38,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.38,0:03:03.23,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.23,0:03:04.05,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.44,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.71,0:03:15.51,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.36,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.36,0:03:17.18,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.18,0:03:18.57,op-english,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}I'll burn it down
Comment: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:21.18,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:11.44,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}世人的眼光中我烈焰焚身
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:17.79,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}眼神中期盼着甜蜜杀戮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:24.34,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}现在我的心中燃起了一簇烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.75,0:02:32.52,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}以我残躯化烈火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:01.58,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}这簇失控的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:02.38,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}让我把这座城市烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:03.23,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:04.05,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.44,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.71,0:03:15.51,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}让我把这座城市烧成灰
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:16.36,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.36,0:03:17.18,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:18.57,op-chs,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\fad(100,300)}烧成灰
Comment: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:38.14,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:53.06,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}They will finally feel the flames
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:57.49,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Flames that run down through my veins
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:23:01.83,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I will make the city burn
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:06.19,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}We're not planning to return
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.95,0:23:10.59,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Trying so hard to be free
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:14.41,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}To make you see what I see
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.78,0:23:19.32,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Hold on to your wishes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:23.14,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}If you can't hold on to me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:26.94,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.83,0:23:32.19,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Forgive me for letting you down again
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.19,0:23:35.39,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}I guess I'm not strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.01,0:23:39.23,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Right now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:46.59,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}Oh my love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.59,0:23:50.92,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.92,0:23:58.21,edd-english,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}love
Comment: 0,0:23:58.77,0:24:00.77,op-english,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.74,0:22:53.06,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}他们终究会擦出爱情之火
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.06,0:22:57.49,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}火化为血液 在我体内流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.49,0:23:01.83,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我会引燃这座都市
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.83,0:23:06.19,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我们从未有撤退的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.95,0:23:10.59,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}努力去获得自由
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:14.41,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只为让你见我所见
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.78,0:23:19.32,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}牢牢抓住你的期盼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.32,0:23:23.14,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}如果你无法再握住我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.34,0:23:26.94,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}请原谅我 让你失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.83,0:23:32.19,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}请原谅我 又一次
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.19,0:23:35.39,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我想还未拥有守护你的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.01,0:23:39.23,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}只为此时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.05,0:23:46.59,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}哦 我的挚爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.59,0:23:50.92,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}我们永恒的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.92,0:23:58.21,edd-chs,,0,0,0,,{\i1\blur2\fad(150,350)}你我永不分离
Comment: 0,0:22:07.83,0:22:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,
